    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i checked the connection pools and the agent limits seem fine. it's just so frustrating. it's like there is some sort of glitch or something living in the pipeline itself that just keeps tripping things up whenever it feels like it. we've looked at everything technical and it's just... weird. is there anything else i should be looking at? maybe something more obscure?",
